  "title": "Hearty Dense Spanish Kale Arroz Negro",
  "description": "A comforting Spanish dish featuring kale and sashimi-cut ingredients, this paleo-friendly arroz negro is a dense and resinous meal option. It is made with a variety of ingredients to provide a hearty and satisfying experience.",
